649
00:36:50,725 --> 00:36:51,976
It's a shame, isn't it?

650
00:36:52,060 --> 00:36:53,352
What?

651
00:36:53,436 --> 00:36:55,938
Well, you probably had another
good two or three years

652
00:36:56,022 --> 00:36:57,439
