that match, you know.

655
00:37:02,362 --> 00:37:04,571
Financially and personally.

656
00:37:04,656 --> 00:37:08,701
Why did you choke out
there that day, Baumer?

657
00:37:08,785 --> 00:37:11,829
Mr. Gandhi leads 40-15.

658
00:37:17,961 --> 00:37:19,795
