687
00:38:39,793 --> 00:38:41,752
Twice. Got me disbarred.

688
00:38:41,836 --> 00:38:44,630
I don't hold it
against you, do I?

689
00:38:44,714 --> 00:38:45,714
And how is it possible

690
00:38:45,799 --> 00:38:47,674
