I wrote to you?

731
00:40:51,674 --> 00:40:53,800
Why? Did she mention it?

732
00:40:56,471 --> 00:40:59,181
Yes, I did.

733
00:40:59,265 --> 00:41:01,975
Why would she
have repeated that, I wonder?

734
00:41:02,060 --> 00:41:04,811
Well, I would ask you
the same question.

735
00:41:06,898 --> 00:41:07,940
