How often do you, uh?

748
00:41:46,562 --> 00:41:48,230
I'm worried about you, Richie.

749
00:41:48,314 --> 00:41:50,232
Why?

750
00:41:50,316 --> 00:41:53,151
Well, actually, Margot is,
