754
00:42:02,495 --> 00:42:04,204
Yeah.

755
00:42:04,289 --> 00:42:06,581
And she's your sister.

756
00:42:06,666 --> 00:42:09,084
Adopted.

757
00:42:19,304 --> 00:42:21,513
Where are my encyclopedias?

758
00:42:21,597 --> 00:42:22,931
