780
00:43:06,809 --> 00:43:09,061
That he come here
and stay in my room.

781
00:43:09,145 --> 00:43:11,646
Are you out of your mind?

782
00:43:11,731 --> 00:43:12,981
No, I'm not.
Anyway, I think that

783
00:43:13,066 --> 00:43:15,317
he'd be much more comfortable
here than he would...

784
00:43:15,401 --> 00:43:16,234
