785
00:43:16,319 --> 00:43:17,903
I do.

786
00:43:17,987 --> 00:43:19,154
You poor sucker.

787
00:43:19,238 --> 00:43:21,490
You poor, washed-up papa's boy.

788
00:43:21,574 --> 00:43:23,033
